        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250008",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Ying'er",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225001201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225001201": {
            "id": "225001201",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Here you are, one bespoke Mint perfume made specially for Lulu by yours truly. You can take it to her now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225001204"
            ]
          },
          "225001204": {
            "id": "225001204",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "She didn't tell me, and I didn't ask her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225001205"
            ]
          },
          "225001205": {
            "id": "225001205",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "No girl is without her secrets. Keeping some things hidden, displaying a penchant for tact, it's all part of a girl's charm.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225001206"
            ]
          },
          "225001206": {
            "id": "225001206",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Alright, off you go now, get this back to Lulu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250009",
      "subQuestName": "Give the perfume to Little Lulu",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250010",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225000801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225000801": {
            "id": "225000801",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Why the hurry? I'm afraid being desperate in and of itself can't bring you what you want."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250002",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225000201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225000201": {
            "id": "225000201",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Well hello again. Missing me already, huh? What are you here for this time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225000202"
            ]
          },
          "225000202": {
            "id": "225000202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "To pick something up for Little Lulu.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225000203"
            ]
          },
          "225000203": {
            "id": "225000203",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Little Lulu? ...Oh yes, that's right. She asked me to make some perfume for her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225000204"
            ]
          },
          "225000204": {
            "id": "225000204",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "But I'm afraid this isn't the best time... For some reason, since you were last here, my sweet-smelling side services have been in exceptionally high demand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225000205"
            ]
          },
          "225000205": {
            "id": "225000205",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "I've had an enormous number of orders. It's far too many for me to handle alone, especially since I also have the shop to attend to.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225000206"
            ]
          },
          "225000206": {
            "id": "225000206",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "On top of that, Lulu's just a child. It would be a little inappropriate to give her the same type of perfume worn by adult women.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225000207"
            ]
          },
          "225000207": {
            "id": "225000207",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "So I was racking my brains trying to think of a way to make my perfume more child-friendly. I've now decided on a suitable formula, but I haven't got around to making it yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225000208"
            ]
          },
          "225000208": {
            "id": "225000208",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "If it absolutely can't wait, expediting it would not be impossible, but..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250004",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225000401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225000401": {
            "id": "225000401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I can help out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225000402"
            ]
          },
          "225000402": {
            "id": "225000402",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Not a bad idea. You do have some experience in these matters, after all. Well, you certainly impressed me last time you were here. *giggle*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225000403"
            ]
          },
          "225000403": {
            "id": "225000403",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "As it happens, I have some of the necessary ingredients on hand. I'll go set up in Chef Mao's kitchen.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225000404"
            ]
          },
          "225000404": {
            "id": "225000404",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Go pick three leaves of Mint, then extract the essential oil at a Crafting Bench. I'm sure you're still intimately acquainted with the technique?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225000405"
            ]
          },
          "225000405": {
            "id": "225000405",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Bring the Mint Essential Oil to me, I'll handle the rest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250009",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225000901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225000901": {
            "id": "225000901",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How does 3,000 Mora sound?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225000903"
            ]
          },
          "225000903": {
            "id": "225000903",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Hmm, it seems you can't quite afford it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250010",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225001001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225001001": {
            "id": "225001001",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Mint Essential Oil, you got it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225001003",
              "225001007"
            ]
          },
          "225001003": {
            "id": "225001003",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "We did it together not long ago, you don't remember? Huh, so you're just as quick to forget as you are to get involved in the first place...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225001004"
            ]
          },
          "225001004": {
            "id": "225001004",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Let me give you a recap then. Go fetch three leaves of Mint, then extract the essential oil at a Crafting Bench.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225001005"
            ]
          },
          "225001005": {
            "id": "225001005",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Bring the essential oil to me, and I will take it from there."
          },
          "225001007": {
            "id": "225001007",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "How to put this... it neutralizes some of the more stimulating elements in the concoction.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225001008"
            ]
          },
          "225001008": {
            "id": "225001008",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "But more importantly, the scent is a good match for a child like Lulu.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225001009"
            ]
          },
          "225001009": {
            "id": "225001009",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "A girl's scent is far more than a purely nasal affair...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225001010"
            ]
          },
          "225001010": {
            "id": "225001010",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "This perfume must capture Lulu's youthful lust for life, her wide-eyed innocence... *giggle*"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250011",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225001101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225001101": {
            "id": "225001101",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "Mint is an appropriate scent for a child like Lulu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250013",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225001301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225001301": {
            "id": "225001301",
            "speakerId": 2083,
            "speakerName": "Ying'er",
            "text": "I don't know why Lulu would have a need for perfume... But I suppose she is growing up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250014",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225001401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225001401": {
            "id": "225001401",
            "speakerId": 12622,
            "speakerName": "Little Lulu",
            "text": "I don't know what's gotten into Little Meng and Little Fei recently..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}